//@version=6
// Gold Structure & Reversal Engine v9.0 — Adaptive Learning M15 Sniper
// Creator: barucci_goon
// Foundation: Preserves the proven core confluence engine and v2 SMC/Fibonacci/SMT gates.
// Upgrade: Preserves the complete v8 engine and adds a bounded adaptive-learning layer:
//          The v5-style early M15 arm candle remains untouched; learning never moves the original setup location.
//          Historical armed setups are evaluated bar-by-bar against T1 or a chosen R-multiple before invalidation.
//          The engine learns separately by side, regime, session, individual confluences and exact 10-feature setup signature.
//          Bayesian smoothing + bounded score adjustment prevents small samples from hijacking the proven v8 rules.
//          Liquidity, structure, SMC, Fib, SMT, nested BB, HTF, fast MA, volume and weekly profile remain the causal engine.
//          Learning only adjusts confidence/final sniper quality after enough resolved samples; Advisory mode leaves signals unchanged.
// Notes: No indicator can guarantee a perfect entry. Final signals use closed-bar confirmation by default.

indicator(
     "Gold Structure & Reversal Engine v9 [barucci_goon]",
     shorttitle = "BGGSREv9",
     overlay = true,
     max_bars_back = 5000,
     max_labels_count = 500,
     max_lines_count = 500,
     max_boxes_count = 500)

